Package: magqc
Title: QA/QC for Airborne Magnetic Survey Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Matthew", "Jorden", email = "matthew.jorden@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Acceptance testing for airborne magnetometer surveys. Reads
    fiducial-level XYZ flight data, evaluates it against a configurable survey
    specification (line spacing, departure from plan, terrain clearance,
    fourth-difference noise, spikes, diurnal variation, tie-line crossover
    misfit, heading error and data gaps), and renders a self-contained HTML
    acceptance report with a map of the flight lines and every flagged
    interval. Ships a synthetic survey generator so the whole workflow is
    reproducible without proprietary data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
